{"resourceIdentifier":"4788","resourceName":"Rizome Kawayan Project 1","description":"The RIZOME KAWAYAN PROJECT 1 is a grouped, Afforestation, Reforestation and Revegetation (ARR) project, planting the native Dendrocalamus asper (giant bamboo) located on Mindanao Island, the Philippines. The project involves planting of giant bamboo in relevant planting sites in mostly ancestral domains of Indigenous Peoples of Mindanao. It is implemented in partnership between RIZOME (an engineered bamboo processing company with facilities in Mindanao), Climate Impact Partners (a leader in developing and delivering high-quality, high-impact carbon market solutions) and Indigenous Communities across Mindanao, all of which have legally recognized ‘Certificates of Ancestral Domain Titles’ (CADTs).","location":{"latitude":8.208690,"longitude":125.101800},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2024-07-16","endExclusive":"2024-08-16","endInclusive":"2024-08-15"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4788"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Mindanao island"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"26459"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ARR"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"VM0047"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"971 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Carbon Check (India) Private Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"05/08/2025"}]},{"cod